# Committed Vite build output: never apply EOL conversion.
# core.autocrlf would otherwise smudge CRLF into the hashed index.js/css.
# outDir is web/ui (not ui/dist).
web/ui/** -text

# Copied verbatim into web/ui by Vite (default publicDir). Same hazard:
# a CRLF-smudged icons.svg re-dirties the -text build copy on every build.
# Contents today: favicon.svg, icons.svg — both asset copies, not hand-edited prose.
ui/public/** -text

# web/js/*.js stays text on purpose: Forge-style plain JS loaded by ComfyUI,
# hand-edited and line-diffable, not generated.
